# xreserve_accept_ownership_note — the shipped, root-pinned accept_ownership admin note (F5).
#
# The production admin surface for the STOCK `accept_ownership` under the network account: a fixed-root,
# PARAM-LESS note whose sole job is to cross into the faucet account context and `call` the
# NOMINATED-owner-gated stock `miden::standards::access::ownable2step::accept_ownership` (step 2 of the
# 2-step transfer). The gate reads the note sender (kernel-forced): only the pending/nominated owner
# succeeds — the current owner and any third party trap. The executor-controlled NOTE_ARGS are dropped
# and never read. The `call` resolves to the SAME proc root the faucet exposes via the
# Ownable2Step component re-exports. A scheme-2 NetworkAccountTarget routing attachment addresses the
# note at the faucet (routing-only, added by the Rust factory).

use miden::standards::access::ownable2step

# PUBLIC INTERFACE
# =================================================================================================

#! Consumes the `accept_ownership` admin note and promotes the nominated owner (step 2 of 2).
#!
#! Drops the executor-controlled note ARGS (the op is param-less) and `call`s the stock
#! `ownable2step::accept_ownership`.
#!
#! Requires that the account exposes:
#! - miden::standards::access::ownable2step::accept_ownership procedure.
#!
#! Inputs:  [ARGS, pad(12)]
#! Outputs: [pad(16)]
#!
#! Panics if:
#! - the note sender is not the nominated owner (accept_ownership's pending-owner gate), or no
#!   ownership transfer is pending.
#!
#! Invocation: dyncall
@note_script
pub proc main
    dropw
    # => [pad(16)]

    call.ownable2step::accept_ownership
    # => [pad(16)]
end
